  "description": "An open, source-backed tracker of AI laws, regulations, strategies and guidance across 249 jurisdictions, with the obligations they create, their deadlines, dated changes and the controls that meet them. Every record links its official source, says whether a named reviewer has checked it, and has a permanent id. Includes a REST API, open data exports, llms.txt and an MCP server for AI assistants.",
